      {"kind": "text", "slot": "intro", "rect": [54, 176, 430, 64], "style": "Headnote", "sample": "This is the soup we make the week the first frost arrives. Roasting the squash with garlic and a little maple deepens its sweetness, and a spoonful of nutty sage butter on top turns a simple bowl into something worth sitting down for."},
